// Temporal anti-aliasing: a sub-pixel jitter of the camera, a velocity pass
// for the objects that move, the resolve that blends each frame into a
// reprojected history, and a sharpening pass. The shaders are taa.slang and
// taavelocity*.slang; fx.cone drives it (ImageFx.render).
